## Legal text

### Article 43 – Databases containing certain data

The sui generis right provided for in Article [7](https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=CELEX:39L0096) of [Directive 96/9/EC](https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=CELEX:31996L0009) shall not apply when data is obtained from or generated by a connected product or related service falling within the scope of [this Regulation](/en/lagstiftning/data-act), in particular in relation to Articles [4](/en/lagstiftning/data-act/kap-2#article-4-the-rights-and-obligations-of-users-and-data-holders-with-regard-to-access-use-and-making-available-product-data-and-related-service-data) and [5](/en/lagstiftning/data-act/kap-2#article-5-right-of-the-user-to-share-data-with-third-parties) thereof.
<!-- scan-laws:end -->

